{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The synthesised "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer stays strict — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(rawValue:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for a value that is not a case — so code that deliberately parses a raw string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its check. Only DECODING, where the alternative is failing a whole response, is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lenient."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decoder","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"role":"symbol","title":"init(from:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK9ManagedByO4fromACs7Decoder_p_tKcfc"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagedBy\/init(from:)-503em","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Decodes an unrecognised value to ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instead of throwing.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy